        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>金陵十二钗正册判词</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #f2ead9;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(150,180,150,0.25) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(150,180,150,0.25) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 18px 18px;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    width: 560px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .title-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n\n  .title-box {\n    background: #b5352f;\n    color: #ffe9c0;\n    border: 2px solid #7a1f1a;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 6px 22px;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(4, auto);\n    gap: 8px 4px;\n  }\n\n  .card {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 4px 2px 10px 2px;\n  }\n\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 78px;\n    border: 1px dashed #c9a37a;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #8a6a4a;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  .name {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #7a2b1f;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .poem {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #3a2a1a;\n    text-align: left;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"title-box\">金陵十二钗正册判词</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <!-- Row 1 -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：林黛玉<br>持扇立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">林黛玉(情情)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        可叹停机德，<br>\n        堪怜咏絮才。<br>\n        玉带林中挂，<br>\n        金簪雪里埋。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：薛宝钗<br>持扇立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">薛宝钗(无情)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        可叹停机德，<br>\n        堪怜咏絮才。<br>\n        玉带林中挂，<br>\n        金簪雪里埋。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：王熙凤<br>华服立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">王熙凤(情辣)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        凡鸟偏从末世来，<br>\n        都知爱慕此生才。<br>\n        一从二令三人木，<br>\n        哭向金陵事更哀。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 2 -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：贾元春<br>凤冠立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">贾元春(情孽)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        二十年来辨是非，<br>\n        榴花开处照宫闱。<br>\n        三春争及初春景，<br>\n        虎兕相逢大梦归。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：贾迎春<br>持花立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">贾迎春(情懦)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        子系中山狼，<br>\n        得志便猖狂。<br>\n        金闺花柳质，<br>\n        一载赴黄粱。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：贾探春<br>华服立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">贾探春(情敏)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        才自精明志自高，<br>\n        生于末世运偏消。<br>\n        清明涕泣江边望，<br>\n        千里东风一梦遥。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 3 -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：贾惜春<br>持物立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">贾惜春(情冷)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        勘破三春景不长，<br>\n        缁衣顿改昔年装。<br>\n        可怜绣户侯门女，<br>\n        独卧青灯古佛旁。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：史湘云<br>持扇立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">史湘云(情憨)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        富贵又何为？<br>\n        襁褥之间父母违。<br>\n        展眼吊斜晖，<br>\n        湘江水逝楚云飞。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：秦可卿<br>华服立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">秦可卿(情秽)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        情天情海幻情身，<br>\n        情既相逢必主淫。<br>\n        漫言不肖皆荣出，<br>\n        造衅开端实在宁。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Row 4 -->\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：妙玉<br>持珠立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">妙玉(情隐)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        欲洁何曾洁？<br>\n        云空未必空。<br>\n        可怜金玉质，<br>\n        终陷淖泥中。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：贾巧姐<br>持物立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">贾巧姐(情缘)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        势败休云贵，<br>\n        家亡莫论亲。<br>\n        偶因济刘氏，<br>\n        巧得遇恩人。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[插图：李纨<br>抱幼儿立像]</div>\n      <div class=\"name\">李纨(情稠)</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        桃李春风结子完，<br>\n        到头谁似一盆兰。<br>\n        如冰水好空相妒，<br>\n        枉与他人作笑谈。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
